-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ADDITIONAL TERM (GNU GPL version 3, section 7, paragraph b)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Every website that displays pages produced by this program, or by a work based
on it, must preserve the author attribution shown in the page footer: the
Paideia Studio logo with the text "Theme developed by Paideia Studio" (or its
translation into the site's language), linked to https://paideiastudio.net/.
The attribution must remain visible and legible on every public page where the
program's footer is shown. It may be restyled to match the site, translated,
or moved within the footer, but not removed, hidden, or made illegible.

Modified versions must carry prominent notices stating that they were changed
and the date of the change (GPL v3, section 5(a)), and must not use the name
"Paideia" in a way that suggests that Paideia Studio endorses or supports the
modified version.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
TÉRMINO ADICIONAL (GNU GPL versión 3, sección 7, párrafo b) — traducción
informativa; prevalece el texto en inglés
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Todo sitio web que muestre páginas generadas por este programa, o por una obra
basada en él, debe conservar la atribución de autoría del pie de página: el
logo de Paideia Studio con el texto "Theme desarrollado por Paideia Studio" (o
su traducción al idioma del sitio), con enlace a https://paideiastudio.net/.
La atribución debe seguir visible y legible en cada página pública donde se
muestre el pie de página del programa. Puede adaptarse al estilo del sitio,
traducirse o moverse dentro del pie, pero no quitarse, ocultarse ni volverse
ilegible.

